{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:56:01.006029404Z","verse":8,"ref":"ezekiel 33:8","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":33,"translation":"When I say to the wicked, \"O wicked one, you shall surely die,\" and you do not speak to warn the wicked ⟨one⟩ from his way — he, the wicked ⟨one⟩, shall die in his iniquity, but his blood from your hand I will require.","tokens":[{"surface":"באמרי","gloss":"When I say"},{"surface":"לרשע","gloss":"to the wicked"},{"surface":"רשע","gloss":"O wicked one"},{"surface":"מות","gloss":"dying"},{"surface":"תמות","gloss":"⟨you shall⟩ surely die"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and you do not"},{"surface":"דברת","gloss":"⟨you⟩ did not speak"},{"surface":"להזהיר","gloss":"to warn"},{"surface":"רשע","gloss":"the wicked"},{"surface":"מדרכו","gloss":"from his way"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"he"},{"surface":"רשע","gloss":"the wicked ⟨one⟩"},{"surface":"בעונו","gloss":"in his iniquity"},{"surface":"ימות","gloss":"shall die"},{"surface":"ודמו","gloss":"and his blood"},{"surface":"מידך","gloss":"from your hand"},{"surface":"אבקש","gloss":"I will seek"}]}